  "content": "<div><div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>多重箭矢效果</strong> 新增了一項合成機制，讓你能夠將最多三種藥水效果合併到一支箭矢上，整合所有特性，創造出極具變化與策略性的投射物。</span></p></div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">這個模組讓你能夠將藥水箭矢結合，並將其特性合併到一次射擊中。你最多可以在同一支箭矢上疊加三種不同的藥水效果，創造出能同時施加多重效果的強大投射物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1396590/description_b5ceb87e-ed2f-456a-9c49-4403ed3be7dc.png\" width=\"368\" height=\"285\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">所有設定皆可完全自訂：你可以調整最大結合效果數量、調整持續時間、封鎖特定藥水，或直接在設定檔中修改合成行為，讓系統適用於任何世界或模組包。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">它與其他箭矢和藥水模組完全相容，能夠應用遊戲中任何藥水的效果。藥水箭矢是透過將滯留藥水圍繞箭矢合成而製成，讓你能應用任何效果，之後再將它們合併為一根強化後的投射物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eb7f55c5-3947-420b-89ff-328b3a283b3e.png\"></span></p></div>\n\n<div><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"353\"></strong></a></p><div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>立即擁有你的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">，與朋友們展開無盡冒險！憑藉頂尖效能與可靠穩定在線時間，我們的伺服器為所有人保證流暢愉快的遊戲體驗。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享 </span><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">75 折優惠！</span></strong></a></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Discord.webp\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span></a></p></div></div></div>",
